WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.900
<v Alice>Can we ship Friday? Or is that too soon?

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:10.500
<v You>Yes, with the hotfix &amp; the &lt;beta&gt; flag.

01:02:05.500 --> 01:02:10.747
<v Alice>Then let's plan the rollout
carefully: first the internal dogfood

01:02:10.747 --> 01:02:15.914
<v Alice>group on Monday, then ten percent
of customers on Wednesday, and

01:02:15.914 --> 01:02:21.000
<v Alice>everyone else by Friday afternoon
if the crash rate stays flat.

01:02:22.000 --> 01:02:23.000
<v Bob>Agreed.
